<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Tradecard - Home</title>
    <link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.0.2/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css" rel="stylesheet"
    integrity="sha384-EVSTQN3/azprG1Anm3QDgpJLIm9Nao0Yz1ztcQTwFspd3yD65VohhpuuCOmLASjC" crossorigin="anonymous">
    <link rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" href="/innerstyle.css">
</head>

<body>
      <%- include ('navbar') %>

    <div class="container mt-5 view-container">

    <h2> Hello guest, welcome </h2>

    <hr>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card m-3">
            
                <div class="card-body">
         <p>Welcome to Tradecard, where you can view and save Pokémon cards!</p>  
         <p>You are using tradecard as a guest. Why not sign up and join the fun!</p>  
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="card m-3">
                <div class="card-header">
                    Member features!
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
           As a member of the tradecard community, you can:
           <ul>
            <li>
                Browse all of tradecard's available pokémon cards
            </li>
            <li>Create as many card collections as you wish</li>
            <li>Browse other user's collections</li>
            <li>Rate other user's collections</li>
            <li>Create a wishlist</li>
           </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="col">
            <div class="card m-3">
                <div class="card-header">
                    Upcoming events!
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                       <li>Pokémon Trainers' Convention - May 15, 2024</li>
        <li>Pokémon Go Safari Zone - June 1, 2024</li>
        <li>Pokémon TCG Tournament - July 10, 2024</li>
        <li>Pokémon World Championships - August 20-22, 2024</li>
        <li>Pokémon Anime Marathon - September 5, 2024</li>
                </div>
            </div>
           
            <div class="card m-3">
                <div class="card-header">
                   Pokémon Fun Facts!
                </div>
                <div class="card-body">
                   <ul>
                    <li>
                        Pokémon started as a video game in 1996.
                    </li>
                    <li>There are over 1000 species of Pokémon.</li>
                    <li>Bulbasaur is the first Pokemon in the Pokedex.</li>
                    <li>Pokemon is short for Pocket Monsters.</li>
                    <li>Pikachu and Meowth are complete opposites.</li>
                   </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
     
    </div>
</div>
      

   

